  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.81,
      "end": 3.89,
      "en": "Hello everyone, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.15,
      "end": 4.61,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 4.97,
      "end": 5.55,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.21,
      "end": 8.31,
      "en": "And where are we going today, Erica?",
      "zh": "埃里卡，我们今天要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 8.51,
      "end": 9.19,
      "en": "To the pharmacy.",
      "zh": "去药房。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 9.64,
      "end": 12.52,
      "en": "All right, to the pharmacy or drugstore?",
      "zh": "好吧，去药房或药店？"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 12.54,
      "end": 12.78,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 13.28,
      "end": 16.58,
      "en": "Or also in British English, sometimes people say the chemist.",
      "zh": "在英式英语里，有时人们还会说 the chemist（药店）。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 17.16,
      "end": 17.38,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 18.24,
      "end": 25.2,
      "en": "So as you know, at the pharmacy you get medicine, but there are certain vocabulary words that are related to this place that we need to learn.",
      "zh": "如你所知，在药房可以买药，但有一些与这个地方相关的词汇我们需要学习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 26.2,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 26.2,
      "end": 30.84,
      "en": "And then some vocabulary about medicine and also some interesting phrases.",
      "zh": "然后是一些关于医学的词汇和一些有趣的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 30.84,
      "end": 34.26,
      "en": "So before we listen to the dialogue, let's take a look at vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "所以在我们听对话之前，让我们看一下词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 36.12,
      "end": 37.76,
      "en": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 37.76,
      "end": 40.61,
      "en": "We're going to look at two words today that you'll hear in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "我们今天将在对话中看到你会听到的两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 41.32,
      "end": 43.27,
      "en": "And the first one, milligrams.",
      "zh": "第一个，毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 44.13,
      "end": 44.32,
      "en": "Milligrams.",
      "zh": "毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 44.32,
      "end": 44.69,
      "en": "Milligrams.",
      "zh": "毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 46.03,
      "end": 48.71,
      "en": "Also, the abbreviation for this is MG.",
      "zh": "此外，该缩写为毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 49.68,
      "end": 50.68,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 50.68,
      "end": 51.68,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 51.68,
      "end": 52.68,
      "en": "So a milligram is?",
      "zh": "那么一毫克是？"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 52.68,
      "end": 53.33,
      "en": "A hundredth of a gram.",
      "zh": "百分之一克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 53.76,
      "end": 56.63,
      "en": "So there are 100 milligrams in a gram.",
      "zh": "所以一克有100毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 56.93,
      "end": 57.19,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 57.63,
      "end": 60.09,
      "en": "And it's very common to be used with medicine, right?",
      "zh": "和药物一起使用是很常见的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 60.29,
      "end": 60.49,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 61.36,
      "end": 62.36,
      "en": "We buy medicine in milligrams.",
      "zh": "我们以毫克为单位购买药品。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 63.03,
      "end": 63.25,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 63.41,
      "end": 64.19,
      "en": "And what's our next word?",
      "zh": "我们的下一个词是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 64.9,
      "end": 65.37,
      "en": "Price check.",
      "zh": "价格查询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 66.04,
      "end": 66.97,
      "en": "A price check.",
      "zh": "价格查询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 67.25,
      "end": 67.89,
      "en": "A price check.",
      "zh": "价格查询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 68.29,
      "end": 68.55,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 68.75,
      "end": 75.67,
      "en": "So at the pharmacy or at the supermarket, sometimes the cashier will ask for a price check.",
      "zh": "所以在药房或超市，有时收银员会要求查一下价格。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 76.05,
      "end": 80.13,
      "en": "And that is the action of checking to find out the price.",
      "zh": "就是查询、确认价格的行为。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 80.69,
      "end": 81.13,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 81.29,
      "end": 82.53,
      "en": "So a price check.",
      "zh": "所以就是价格查询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 83.05,
      "end": 86.57,
      "en": "With this, I think we're ready now to listen to our dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "有了这个，我想我们现在已经准备好第一次听我们的对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 87.07,
      "end": 89.73,
      "en": "And let's see what our shopper is buying at the pharmacy.",
      "zh": "让我们看看我们的购物者在药房购买了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 98.96,
      "end": 99.64,
      "en": "Hello, sir.",
      "zh": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 100.02,
      "end": 100.86,
      "en": "How can I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 101.26,
      "end": 101.7,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 101.84,
      "end": 104.0,
      "en": "I need this prescription, please.",
      "zh": "我来按处方取药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 104.44,
      "end": 105.1,
      "en": "Let's see.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 105.44,
      "end": 105.72,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 106.72,
      "end": 108.92,
      "en": "So 50 milligrams of Prozac.",
      "zh": "百忧解，每粒五十毫克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 108.92,
      "end": 110.56,
      "en": "Would you prefer this in capsule or tablet?",
      "zh": "您要胶囊还是片剂？"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 111.44,
      "end": 112.44,
      "en": "Capsules are fine.",
      "zh": "胶囊就行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 112.44,
      "end": 112.74,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 113.44,
      "end": 115.42,
      "en": "You should take one capsule three times a day.",
      "zh": "每天服用三次，每次一粒胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 116.04,
      "end": 120.42,
      "en": "Be sure not to take it on an empty stomach and also don't ever mix it with alcohol.",
      "zh": "不要空腹服药，也绝对不要与酒同服。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 120.96,
      "end": 121.9,
      "en": "Yes, I know.",
      "zh": "是的，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 122.3,
      "end": 123.56,
      "en": "It's not the first time I'm taking this.",
      "zh": "我不是第一次服用这种药了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 123.9,
      "end": 124.36,
      "en": "Don't worry.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 125.16,
      "end": 126.16,
      "en": "I won't overdose.",
      "zh": "我不会服药过量的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 126.16,
      "end": 127.16,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 127.16,
      "end": 128.22,
      "en": "Anything else I can get you?",
      "zh": "还需要别的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 129.36,
      "end": 130.02,
      "en": "Oh, yes.",
      "zh": "哦，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 130.28,
      "end": 130.94,
      "en": "I almost forgot.",
      "zh": "我差点忘了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 131.36,
      "end": 134.32,
      "en": "Can I also get some eye drops and some condoms?",
      "zh": "我也可以买一些眼药水和一些避孕套吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 135.32,
      "end": 136.32,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 136.95,
      "end": 139.29,
      "en": "Darn, condoms aren't registered in our system.",
      "zh": "糟了，避孕套没录入系统。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 139.73,
      "end": 140.73,
      "en": "Oh, well, that's okay.",
      "zh": "哦，那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 140.99,
      "end": 141.53,
      "en": "I'll get some later.",
      "zh": "我回头再买。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 141.69,
      "end": 141.91,
      "en": "Thanks.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 142.27,
      "end": 143.17,
      "en": "Really, it's no problem.",
      "zh": "真的，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 143.69,
      "end": 145.17,
      "en": "Just hang on there a sec.",
      "zh": "请稍等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 147.09,
      "end": 150.07,
      "en": "Can I get a price check on Funtime's ribbed condoms, please?",
      "zh": "请帮忙查一下Funtime牌螺纹避孕套的价格！"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 157.51,
      "end": 158.09,
      "en": "Oh, no.",
      "zh": "哦，不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 158.33,
      "end": 159.05,
      "en": "How embarrassing.",
      "zh": "太丢人了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 159.77,
      "end": 165.37,
      "en": "A little bit embarrassing that she asked for a price check on these condoms, right?",
      "zh": "她要求查一下这些避孕套的价格，有点尴尬，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 165.63,
      "end": 165.87,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 166.11,
      "end": 166.97,
      "en": "But you know what?",
      "zh": "不过你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 167.72,
      "end": 172.21,
      "en": "It seems like every time you have to buy something embarrassing at the pharmacy, there's a million people watching you.",
      "zh": "似乎每次你在药房买一些令人尴尬的东西时，都有一百万人在看着你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 172.64,
      "end": 173.64,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 173.64,
      "end": 173.89,
      "en": "It never fails.",
      "zh": "屡试不爽。"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 174.64,
      "end": 175.64,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 175.64,
      "end": 182.72,
      "en": "Well, let's take a look at some of those words that we were talking about related to medicine in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们来看看我们在语言要点中谈论的与医学相关的一些词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
