      "en": "Prescription.",
      "zh": "处方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 189.8,
      "end": 191.12,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 191.12,
      "end": 192.22,
      "en": "So what is a prescription?",
      "zh": "那么什么是处方？"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 192.7,
      "end": 197.5,
      "en": "Well, a prescription is a note from your doctor explaining what medicine you need.",
      "zh": "好吧，处方是您的医生的说明，说明您需要什么药物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 197.78,
      "end": 202.16,
      "en": "So this note from your doctor is necessary to buy that medicine, right?",
      "zh": "所以你的医生的这张说明是购买该药的必要条件，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 202.16,
      "end": 202.36,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 203.84,
