      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 204.84,
      "end": 205.84,
      "en": "Prescription.",
      "zh": "处方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 205.84,
      "end": 212.4,
      "en": "Well, this shopper was getting some medicine and, well, the chemist or the pharmacist asked if he wanted it in capsules or tablets.",
      "zh": "嗯，这位顾客正在买药，那位药剂师（chemist 或 pharmacist）问他要胶囊还是药片。"
    },
