      "end": 213.56,
      "en": "So let's look at those two words.",
      "zh": "所以让我们看看这两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 213.92,
      "end": 214.92,
      "en": "A capsule.",
      "zh": "胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 215.41,
      "end": 215.97,
      "en": "Capsule.",
      "zh": "胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 216.11,
      "end": 216.57,
      "en": "Capsule.",
      "zh": "胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 216.81,
      "end": 220.23,
      "en": "Now, a capsule is like a small tube, right?",
      "zh": "现在，胶囊就像一根小管，对吧？"
    },
