      "end": 242.68,
      "en": "Both are the same thing basically, but just different presentations.",
      "zh": "两者基本上都是相同的，但只是不同的演示。"
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "start": 243.28,
      "end": 243.68,
      "en": "Different shapes.",
      "zh": "不同的形状。"
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "start": 243.68,
      "end": 244.68,
      "en": "Different shapes.",
      "zh": "不同的形状。"
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "start": 244.68,
      "end": 245.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "start": 245.68,
      "end": 247.4,
      "en": "It's easier maybe for some people to swallow a capsule.",
      "zh": "有些人可能更容易吞下胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 247.4,
      "end": 247.76,
      "en": "You think so?",
      "zh": "你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 248.06,
      "end": 248.54,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 248.6,
      "end": 249.18,
      "en": "I think so.",
      "zh": "我想是的。"
