      "id": 118,
      "start": 250.4,
      "end": 251.4,
      "en": "Well, like-",
      "zh": "嗯，喜欢——"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "start": 251.4,
      "end": 254.56,
      "en": "Because sometimes tablets are a little bit like big circles and it's hard to swallow.",
      "zh": "因为有时候药片有点像个大圆片，很难吞下去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "start": 254.56,
      "end": 255.56,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
