      "id": 122,
      "start": 258.08,
      "end": 258.78,
      "en": "Yeah, exactly.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "start": 259.06,
      "end": 265.02,
      "en": "But we're not pharmacists, so let's move on and focus on the language, which is what we do know about.",
      "zh": "但我们不是药剂师，所以让我们继续关注语言，这就是我们所知道的。"
    },
