      "start": 265.02,
      "end": 269.27,
      "en": "So the pharmacist warned the patient not to take too much medicine, right?",
      "zh": "所以药剂师警告病人不要吃太多药，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 270.6,
      "end": 271.6,
      "en": "Because he might overdose.",
      "zh": "因为他可能过量服用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 271.6,
      "end": 272.6,
      "en": "Overdose.",
      "zh": "过量。"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 272.6,
      "end": 273.6,
      "en": "Overdose.",
      "zh": "过量。"
