      "en": "So if you overdose on medicine, it could be bad for you instead of good.",
      "zh": "所以如果你服药过量，它可能对你有害而不是好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 286.64,
      "end": 287.87,
      "en": "Well, obviously very bad.",
      "zh": "嗯，显然非常糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 288.96,
      "end": 291.45,
      "en": "And what about our last word for today?",
      "zh": "那我们今天最后一个词呢？"
