      "zh": "好吧，购物者还要了一些眼药水。"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 295.13,
      "end": 295.73,
      "en": "Eye drops.",
      "zh": "眼药水。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 296.07,
      "end": 296.47,
      "en": "Eye drops.",
      "zh": "眼药水。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 297.07,
      "end": 299.15,
      "en": "So this is medicine for your eyes.",
      "zh": "所以这是你眼睛的药。"
