      "end": 302.53,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 303.01,
      "end": 309.29,
      "en": "So I think now with this medicine language clear, we can listen to our dialogue again, but it's going to be slowed down a little bit.",
      "zh": "现在这些和药物相关的词都清楚了，我们可以再听一遍对话，不过速度会放慢一点。"
    },
