      "en": "Yes, I know.",
      "zh": "是的，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 352.88,
      "end": 354.48,
      "en": "It's not the first time I'm taking this.",
      "zh": "我不是第一次服用这种药了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "start": 355.52,
      "end": 355.74,
      "en": "Don't worry.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
