      "id": 204,
      "start": 495.48,
      "end": 496.48,
      "en": "Wait.",
      "zh": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "id": 205,
      "start": 496.48,
      "end": 497.79,
      "en": "It's an informal way of saying wait.",
      "zh": "这是一种非正式的表达方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 206,
      "start": 498.21,
      "end": 498.43,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 207,
      "start": 498.63,
      "end": 501.15,
      "en": "It's also a little bit more friendly than just saying wait.",
      "zh": "它也比仅仅说等待更友好一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 208,
      "start": 501.53,
      "end": 501.73,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 209,
      "start": 501.97,
      "end": 502.23,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "start": 502.69,
      "end": 505.53,
      "en": "And we can change the time a little bit, right?",
      "zh": "我们可以稍微改变一下时间，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 211,
      "start": 505.69,
      "end": 505.83,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 212,
      "start": 506.01,
      "end": 507.85,
      "en": "So we can say hang on a second.",
      "zh": "所以我们可以说等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 213,
      "start": 508.47,
      "end": 509.95,
      "en": "Or hang on a moment.",
      "zh": "或者 hang on a moment。"
    },
    {
      "id": 214,
      "start": 510.31,
      "end": 511.03,
      "en": "Hang on a minute.",
      "zh": "等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 215,
      "start": 511.41,
      "end": 511.75,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 216,
      "start": 512.03,
      "end": 513.05,
      "en": "What about hang on an hour?",
      "zh": "那 hang on an hour 呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 217,
      "start": 513.43,
      "end": 516.93,
      "en": "Well, maybe if you're telling someone to wait for an hour, just hang on there for an hour.",
      "zh": "嗯，如果你让某人等一个小时，那可以说 just hang on there for an hour。"
    },
