      "id": 218,
      "start": 517.07,
      "end": 517.77,
      "en": "I'll be there soon.",
      "zh": "我很快就会到那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 219,
      "start": 517.99,
      "end": 518.15,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 220,
      "start": 518.15,
      "end": 519.97,
      "en": "But I guess it's more common hang on a minute.",
      "zh": "不过我觉得 hang on a minute 更常用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 221,
      "start": 520.17,
      "end": 520.29,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 222,
      "start": 521.32,
      "end": 522.68,
      "en": "Maybe for shorter periods of time.",
      "zh": "也许是较短的时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 223,
      "start": 522.68,
      "end": 523.68,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 224,
      "start": 523.68,
      "end": 530.36,
      "en": "So with these phrases, I think now we can use them in different circumstances, obviously not only in the pharmacy.",
      "zh": "所以有了这些短语，我想现在我们可以在不同的情况下使用它们，显然不仅仅是在药房中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 530.36,
      "end": 540.76,
      "en": "But let's listen to our dialogue for the last time.",
      "zh": "但让我们最后一次听我们的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 540.76,
      "end": 541.76,
      "en": "Hello sir.",
      "zh": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 541.76,
      "end": 542.43,
      "en": "How can I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 542.87,
      "end": 543.21,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 543.47,
      "end": 545.65,
      "en": "I need this prescription, please.",
      "zh": "我来按处方取药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 545.89,
      "end": 546.65,
      "en": "Let's see.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 547.32,
      "end": 548.32,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 548.32,
      "end": 549.65,
      "en": "So 50 milligrams of Prozac.",
      "zh": "所以50毫克百忧解。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 550.52,
      "end": 552.13,
      "en": "Would you prefer this in capsule or tablet?",
      "zh": "您要胶囊还是片剂？"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 553.04,
      "end": 554.44,
      "en": "Capsules are fine.",
      "zh": "胶囊就行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 554.44,
      "end": 555.44,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 555.44,
      "end": 556.97,
      "en": "You should take one capsule three times a day.",
      "zh": "每天服用三次，每次一粒胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 557.64,
      "end": 561.97,
      "en": "Be sure not to take it on an empty stomach and also don't ever mix it with alcohol.",
      "zh": "不要空腹服药，也绝对不要与酒同服。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 562.53,
      "end": 563.45,
      "en": "Yes, I know.",
      "zh": "是的，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 563.85,
      "end": 565.11,
      "en": "It's not the first time I'm taking this.",
      "zh": "我不是第一次服用这种药了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 565.43,
      "end": 565.95,
      "en": "Don't worry.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 566.76,
      "end": 567.76,
      "en": "I won't overdose.",
      "zh": "我不会服药过量的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 567.76,
      "end": 568.92,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 568.92,
      "end": 569.75,
      "en": "Anything else I can get you?",
      "zh": "还需要别的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 570.91,
      "end": 571.57,
      "en": "Oh, yes.",
      "zh": "哦，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 571.75,
      "end": 572.49,
      "en": "I almost forgot.",
      "zh": "我差点忘了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 572.91,
      "end": 575.89,
      "en": "Can I also get some eye drops and some condoms?",
      "zh": "我也可以买一些眼药水和一些避孕套吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 576.63,
      "end": 576.95,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 578.6,
      "end": 580.86,
      "en": "Darn, condoms aren't registered in our system.",
      "zh": "糟了，避孕套没录入系统。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 581.36,
      "end": 582.28,
      "en": "Oh, well, that's okay.",
      "zh": "哦，那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 582.56,
      "end": 583.1,
      "en": "I'll get some later.",
      "zh": "我回头再买。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 583.32,
      "end": 583.48,
      "en": "Thanks.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 583.78,
      "end": 584.74,
      "en": "Really, it's no problem.",
      "zh": "真的，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 585.22,
      "end": 586.7,
      "en": "Just hang on there a sec.",
      "zh": "请稍等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 589.08,
      "end": 591.63,
      "en": "Can I get a price check on Funtimes Ribbed Condoms, please?",
      "zh": "请帮我查一下 FunTimes 螺纹避孕套的价格好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 597.8,
      "end": 598.28,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 598.5,
      "end": 601.78,
      "en": "So with medicine, an interesting thing comes up, right?",
      "zh": "所以有了医学，一个有趣的事情出现了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 602.2,
      "end": 602.5,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 602.84,
      "end": 605.42,
      "en": "A lot of people think that you eat medicine.",
      "zh": "很多人认为你吃药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 605.93,
      "end": 606.27,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 606.76,
      "end": 607.09,
      "en": "Or drink medicine?",
      "zh": "还是喝药？"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 607.76,
      "end": 608.76,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 608.76,
      "end": 610.09,
      "en": "But in English, you always take medicine.",
      "zh": "但用英语，你总是吃药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 610.92,
      "end": 611.61,
      "en": "Always take medicine.",
      "zh": "总是吃药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 611.92,
      "end": 612.92,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 612.92,
      "end": 614.59,
      "en": "So you never can say, oh, I ate my medicine yesterday.",
      "zh": "所以你永远不能说，哦，我昨天吃了我的药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 615.13,
      "end": 616.95,
      "en": "It always has to be, I took my medicine.",
      "zh": "它总是必须的，我吃了我的药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 617.17,
      "end": 617.37,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 618.2,
      "end": 619.2,
      "en": "So you take the capsules.",
      "zh": "所以你服用胶囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 619.2,
      "end": 620.2,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 620.2,
      "end": 620.33,
      "en": "Or take the tablets.",
      "zh": "或服用药片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 621.2,
      "end": 622.2,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 622.2,
      "end": 622.43,
      "en": "So you take medicine.",
      "zh": "所以你吃药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 623.2,
      "end": 628.96,
      "en": "Now, an interesting thing in the United States, for example, it's very hard to get medicine without a prescription.",
      "zh": "现在，在美国，一件有趣的事情，没有处方就很难获得药物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 628.96,
      "end": 629.96,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 629.96,
      "end": 635.12,
      "en": "So we always talk about prescription medicine and OTC medicine or over-the-counter medicine.",
      "zh": "所以我们总是谈论处方药和非处方药或非处方药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 635.68,
      "end": 637.68,
      "en": "So over-the-counter medicine is?",
      "zh": "那么非处方药是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 637.68,
      "end": 641.42,
      "en": "Is medicine you can just buy without that prescription or note from your doctor.",
      "zh": "就是不需要医生处方或说明就能直接买到的药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 641.76,
      "end": 641.94,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 641.96,
      "end": 646.6,
      "en": "So for example, if you have a headache, you can go to the pharmacy and buy aspirin.",
      "zh": "例如，如果你头疼，你可以去药房买阿司匹林。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 646.76,
      "end": 647.76,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 647.76,
      "end": 649.64,
      "en": "And that's over-the-counter medicine.",
      "zh": "那是非处方药。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 649.64,
      "end": 652.87,
      "en": "But prescription medicine, you can't get it without the doctor's note.",
      "zh": "但是处方药，没有医生的说明你就无法得到它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 653.16,
      "end": 654.16,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 654.16,
      "end": 656.63,
      "en": "And like you said, in America, you almost have to have a prescription for everything.",
      "zh": "就像你说的，在美国，几乎什么都得凭处方才能买。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 657.08,
      "end": 659.77,
      "en": "Which is strange because people can overdose on aspirin.",
      "zh": "这很奇怪，因为人们可以过量服用阿司匹林。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 661.36,
      "end": 665.09,
      "en": "So tell us how medicine and pharmacies work in your countries.",
      "zh": "因此，请告诉我们您所在国家/地区的药品和药房如何运作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 665.74,
      "end": 672.36,
      "en": "And also if you have questions or comments, our website, EnglishPod.com is always open and ready for you.",
      "zh": "此外，如果您有任何问题或意见，我们的网站 Englishpod.com 始终开放并为您准备好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 672.36,
      "end": 674.36,
      "en": "So thanks for downloading this lesson, you guys.",
      "zh": "谢谢大家下载这一课。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 674.36,
      "end": 675.36,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "下次再见，拜拜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 675.36,
      "end": 684.878,
      "en": "We'll see you guys out there.",
      "zh": "我们会在那里见到你们。"
    }
  ],
